title AVG-10 Read AVG Verification Logs
participant Registry_Admin_User
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant AVG_Log_Store
participant Service
==REGISTRY ADMIN VIEW==
Registry_Admin_User->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:open verification log (last 30 days; service, result, reason filters)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:check role + organisation scope
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG_Log_Store:query
AVG_Log_Store-->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:entries (claim names only, never values)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:mask holder DID (first 12 + last 4)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Registry_Admin_User:log entries, 20 per page, newest first
==SERVICE LOG API==
Service->AVG_Log_Store:GET verification logs (API key)
AVG_Log_Store-->Service:own entries only, last 30 days
alt OTHER COMPANY SERVICE
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Registry_Admin_User:403, attempt logged
end
alt ENTRY OLDER THAN 30 DAYS
AVG_Log_Store->AVG_Log_Store:daily clean-up deletes it
end
